    { "id": "pref-ts-style", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/typescript-style.md",
      "body": "Lin 在 TypeScript 项目里偏好 2 空格缩进、单引号、不写分号，使用 Prettier 且 printWidth 为 100；提交前运行 prettier --check。" },
    { "id": "pref-py-style", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/python-style.md",
      "body": "Lin 在 Python 项目里使用 black（行宽 88、双引号）和 ruff；类型检查使用 pyright strict 模式。" },
    { "id": "pref-commit", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/commit-messages.md",
      "body": "提交信息使用英文 Conventional Commits：scope 写包名，正文说明为什么改；不要把多人的提交 squash 成一个。" },
    { "id": "pref-test-runner", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/test-runner.md",
      "body": "Lin 偏好 Vitest 而不是 Jest；测试文件和源文件放在同一目录，命名为 *.test.ts；快照测试只用于序列化输出。" },
    { "id": "pref-review-lang", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/review-language.md",
      "body": "代码评审和技术解释用中文回复，技术术语、命令和代码标识符保留英文原文。" },
    { "id": "pm-old", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/tidepool-package-manager-2025.md",
      "body": "（2025 年记录）tidepool-web 使用 Yarn 1 管理依赖，仓库提交 yarn.lock。" },
    { "id": "pm-new", "scope": "user", "path": "preferences/lin/tidepool-package-manager.md",
      "body": "2026-05 起 tidepool-web 改用 pnpm 10 并开启 corepack；仓库中不再允许出现 yarn.lock，CI 使用 pnpm install --frozen-lockfile。此记录取代 2025 年的 Yarn 1 约定。" },
    { "id": "ent-harbor", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/project/harbor-api.md",
      "body": "harbor-api：Go 1.23 编写的计费后端服务，数据库为 PostgreSQL 16，负责 Stripe 计费 webhook 和发票生成。" },
