      "body": "tidepool-web：React 19 + Vite 的前端控制台，样式使用 Tailwind CSS 4，部署在 Cloudflare Pages，通过 harbor-api 的 REST 接口取数。" },
    { "id": "ent-kelp", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/project/kelp-cli.md",
      "body": "kelp-cli：Rust 编写的命令行工具（clap 4），用 cargo-dist 发布 macOS arm64 与 Linux x86_64 二进制，并通过 Homebrew tap 分发。" },
    { "id": "ent-mira", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/person/mira.md",
      "body": "Mira：harbor-api 的 on-call 负责人；所有生产数据库迁移必须先得到 Mira 的审批。" },
    { "id": "ent-oskar", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/person/oskar.md",
      "body": "Oskar：tidepool-web 设计系统的维护者，负责颜色与间距 design tokens 变更的评审。" },
    { "id": "node-old", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/runtime/node-version-2025.md",
      "body": "（2025 年记录）所有 Node 项目统一使用 Node.js 20 LTS。" },
    { "id": "node-new", "scope": "user", "path": "entities/runtime/node-version.md",
      "body": "2026-04 起 Node 项目统一升级到 Node.js 24，.nvmrc 写 24，CI 矩阵不再测试 Node 20。此记录取代 2025 年的 Node 20 约定。" },
    { "id": "evt-migration-lock", "scope": "user", "path": "events/2026/08/14/harbor-orders-migration-lock.md",
      "body": "2026-08-14 harbor-api 上线了一个给 orders 表加带默认值 NOT NULL 列的迁移，导致表锁 9 分钟、结账接口超时，随后回滚。结论：大表先加可空列，分批回填，最后再加约束。" },
    { "id": "evt-cf-cache", "scope": "user", "path": "events/2026/09/02/tidepool-stale-index-html.md",
      "body": "2026-09-02 tidepool-web 发布后部分用户白屏：Cloudflare 缓存了旧的 index.html，它引用的旧 JS chunk 已被删除。修复：index.html 设置 Cache-Control: no-cache，静态资源使用内容哈希文件名并保留上一版本资源。" },
    { "id": "evt-redis-stampede", "scope": "user", "path": "events/2026/08/28/harbor-redis-stampede.md",
      "body": "2026-08-28 harbor-api 价格缓存的热点 key 同时过期，大量请求击穿到 PostgreSQL，数据库 CPU 被打满。修复：TTL 加随机抖动，并用 singleflight 合并相同 key 的回源请求。" },
    { "id": "evt-kelp-gatekeeper", "scope": "user", "path": "events/2026/07/20/kelp-gatekeeper-block.md",
      "body": "2026-07-20 用户反馈 kelp-cli 的 macOS 二进制被 Gatekeeper 拦截无法打开，原因是发布产物没有公证。之后在 CI 发布流程中加入 codesign 和 notarytool 公证步骤。" },
    { "id": "evt-tidepool-a11y", "scope": "user", "path": "events/2026/09/18/tidepool-a11y-audit.md",
      "body": "2026-09-18 tidepool-web 无障碍审计发现：图标按钮缺少 aria-label，焦点环被全局 outline: none 去掉，次要文字对比度只有 3.1:1。已排期修复。" },
    { "id": "exp-flaky-timers", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/vitest-fake-timers-flaky.md",
      "body": "Vitest 使用 fake timers 时，如果被测代码在 Promise 回调里再设置定时器，测试会偶发超时。做法：使用 await vi.advanceTimersByTimeAsync() 或 vi.runAllTimersAsync()，不要用同步的 vi.runAllTimers()。" },
    { "id": "exp-pg-concurrent-index", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/postgres-concurrent-index.md",
      "body": "在 PostgreSQL 大表上建索引要用 CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY，它不能在事务中执行；harbor-api 的 goose 迁移文件需要加 -- +goose NO TRANSACTION 注释。" },
    { "id": "exp-rust-musl", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/rust-musl-cross-compile.md",
      "body": "kelp-cli 交叉编译 Linux musl 目标时 openssl-sys 链接失败。解决：把 reqwest 切到 rustls-tls 特性，去掉对系统 OpenSSL 的依赖，并用 cargo-zigbuild 构建。" },
    { "id": "exp-hydration", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/react-hydration-date.md",
      "body": "tidepool-web 出现 hydration mismatch 警告，原因是组件渲染时直接调用 Date.now() 格式化时间。把时间相关渲染移到 useEffect，或由服务端传入固定时间戳。" },
    { "id": "exp-go-ctx-leak", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/go-context-goroutine-leak.md",
      "body": "harbor-api 内存缓慢增长，pprof 显示 goroutine 泄漏：后台任务用 context.Background() 启动，请求取消时不会退出。改为从请求 context 派生并设置超时。" },
    { "id": "dep-old", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/harbor-deploy-heroku.md",
      "body": "（2025 年记录）harbor-api 部署在 Heroku，数据库迁移在 release phase 随部署自动执行。" },
    { "id": "dep-new", "scope": "user", "path": "experiences/harbor-deploy-fly.md",
      "body": "2026-06 起 harbor-api 从 Heroku 迁到 Fly.io（nrt 区域）。数据库迁移不再随部署自动运行，而是在部署前通过单独的 migrate job 手动触发，并需要 Mira 审批。此记录取代此前的 Heroku 部署方式。" },
    { "id": "case-webhook", "scope": "user", "path": "cases/stripe-webhook-idempotency.md",
      "body": "任务：处理 Stripe webhook 重复投递。做法：以 event.id 建唯一约束的 processed_events 表，在同一事务中写入事件记录和业务变更；重复事件直接返回 200。" },
    { "id": "peer-main-runbook", "scope": "actor", "path": "experiences/local-dev-setup.md",
      "body": "当前工作区的本地开发：先运行 docker compose up postgres redis，再执行 make seed 导入测试数据；harbor-api 本地端口 8081，tidepool-web 开发服务器端口 5173。" },
    { "id": "peer-acme-stack", "scope": "other", "path": "entities/project/acme-portal.md",
      "body": "acme-portal：客户 Acme 的项目，Java 17 + Spring Boot 3，使用 Gradle 构建，发布需要连接客户 VPN 并由客户 PM 审批。" },
    { "id": "peer-acme-window", "scope": "other", "path": "experiences/acme-deploy-window.md",
